Absolutely! 👍 I'll guide you step by step, assuming you're doing this for your DevOps lab or practical examination.

Your task is to:

Take a project from a GitHub repository → Build it using Jenkins → Generate a WAR file → Deploy that WAR file onto an Apache Tomcat server → Open the application in a browser.

We'll use the Jenkins web dashboard, so you can perform most of the work through the browser.

