6. Configure JDK and Maven in Jenkins
Go to:

Dashboard → Manage Jenkins → Tools

JDK configuration
Under JDK installations:

Name: JDK

Set JAVA_HOME to your actual JDK installation directory.

Example:

C:\Program Files\Java\jdk-17
Maven configuration
Under Maven installations:

Name: Maven

Select Install automatically, or specify your installed Maven directory.

Example:

C:\apache-maven
Click Save.

Jenkins uses these tool configurations to prepare the build environment. 

